@startuml
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam sequence {
    GroupBodyBackgroundColor transparent
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #F0F0F0
}

actor User
participant Agent
database "Filesystem & Memory" as FS

title SDD v3.0: User Interaction & Approval Flow

== Phase 0: Discovery & Intent Analysis ==

User -> Agent: Request Task (Description)
Agent -> FS: list_files(".skills/")
FS --> Agent: Skill List
Agent -> FS: Read YAML frontmatter of matching skills
Agent -> Agent: **Announce Skill Activation**
Agent -> Agent: Complexity Check (> 2 files / Arch Change?)

alt Complexity Threshold Met
    Agent -> User: Conduct Interview (Impact Analysis / Risk)
    User -> Agent: Provide Context & Requirements

    Agent -> FS: Create `prompts/plans/<plan_name>/`
    Agent -> FS: Generate Phased GSD Spec (using TASK_SPEC.md)
    Agent -> User: **Present Spec for Approval**

    User -> Agent: "Approve Spec"
else Simple Task
    Agent -> User: Propose One-off Plan
    User -> Agent: "Approve Plan"
end

== Atomic Phase Execution ==

loop For each Phase in Spec
    Agent -> FS: Read Phase Tasks & `memory/` log
    Agent -> FS: Execute Phase Logic (Atomic edits)
    Agent -> FS: Update `memory/` with discoveries/unexpected behavior
    Agent -> Agent: Run Verification Steps
    Agent -> User: Report Phase Completion & Verification Results

    note over Agent, User #FFAAAA
        **HARD STOP RULE**
        Agent is prohibited from proceeding to next phase
    end note

    User -> Agent: **"Proceed" / Phase Approval**
end

== Finalization & Cleanup ==

Agent -> FS: Execute Final Cleanup (Cleanup & Manual Actions)
Agent -> User: Present Final Deliverables & Logs
User -> Agent: Final Acceptance

@enduml